## Generate DIA-NN predicted spectral libraries from FASTA

Before running DIA-NN on the raw files, we generate predicted spectral libraries from the FASTA databases.

This tutorial creates two libraries:

| Library | FASTA input | Use case |
|---|---|---|
| Human-only library | `human_swissprot_reviewed.fasta` | Pooled tear-fluid DIA files |
| Human + *E. coli* library | `human_ecoli_swissprot_reviewed.fasta` | Dilution samples containing human tear peptides mixed with *E. coli* digest |

The generated libraries will be saved in:

```text
results/diann/libraries/
```

This step assumes that the DIA-NN Docker image is already available as:

```text
diann:latest
```

Create the library-generation script:

```bash
cat > generate_diann_libraries.sh <<'EOF'
#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

echo "======================================================"
echo " Generating DIA-NN predicted spectral libraries"
echo "======================================================"

# Docker image
DIANN_IMAGE="diann:latest"

# FASTA input files
HUMAN_FASTA="fasta/human_swissprot_reviewed.fasta"
HUMAN_ECOLI_FASTA="fasta/human_ecoli_swissprot_reviewed.fasta"

# Output folder
OUT_DIR="results/diann/libraries"

# Output spectral libraries
HUMAN_LIB="${OUT_DIR}/human_swissprot.predicted.speclib"
HUMAN_ECOLI_LIB="${OUT_DIR}/human_ecoli_swissprot.predicted.speclib"

# Number of threads
THREADS="${THREADS:-8}"

echo ""
echo "Checking Docker image..."

if ! docker image inspect "$DIANN_IMAGE" > /dev/null 2>&1; then
  echo "ERROR: Docker image not found: $DIANN_IMAGE"
  echo "Build or pull the DIA-NN Docker image first."
  exit 1
fi

echo "Docker image found: $DIANN_IMAGE"

echo ""
echo "Checking FASTA files..."

if [ ! -f "$HUMAN_FASTA" ]; then
  echo "ERROR: Human FASTA file not found:"
  echo "$HUMAN_FASTA"
  exit 1
fi

if [ ! -f "$HUMAN_ECOLI_FASTA" ]; then
  echo "ERROR: Combined human + E. coli FASTA file not found:"
  echo "$HUMAN_ECOLI_FASTA"
  exit 1
fi

echo "FASTA files found."

echo ""
echo "Creating output folder..."
mkdir -p "$OUT_DIR"

echo ""
echo "======================================================"
echo " 1/2 Generating human-only predicted spectral library"
echo "======================================================"
echo ""
echo "Input FASTA:"
echo "  $HUMAN_FASTA"
echo ""
echo "Output library:"
echo "  $HUMAN_LIB"
echo ""

docker run --rm \
  -v "$PWD:/data" \
  "$DIANN_IMAGE" \
  --fasta "/data/${HUMAN_FASTA}" \
  --fasta-search \
  --gen-spec-lib \
  --predictor \
  --cut "K*,R*,!*P" \
  --missed-cleavages 1 \
  --min-pep-len 7 \
  --max-pep-len 30 \
  --min-pr-charge 2 \
  --max-pr-charge 4 \
  --met-excision \
  --fixed-mod Carbamidomethyl,57.021464,C \
  --var-mod Oxidation,15.994915,M \
  --var-mods 1 \
  --out-lib "/data/${HUMAN_LIB}" \
  --threads "$THREADS"

echo ""
echo "======================================================"
echo " 2/2 Generating human + E. coli predicted spectral library"
echo "======================================================"
echo ""
echo "Input FASTA:"
echo "  $HUMAN_ECOLI_FASTA"
echo ""
echo "Output library:"
echo "  $HUMAN_ECOLI_LIB"
echo ""

docker run --rm \
  -v "$PWD:/data" \
  "$DIANN_IMAGE" \
  --fasta "/data/${HUMAN_ECOLI_FASTA}" \
  --fasta-search \
  --gen-spec-lib \
  --predictor \
  --cut "K*,R*,!*P" \
  --missed-cleavages 1 \
  --min-pep-len 7 \
  --max-pep-len 30 \
  --min-pr-charge 2 \
  --max-pr-charge 4 \
  --met-excision \
  --fixed-mod Carbamidomethyl,57.021464,C \
  --var-mod Oxidation,15.994915,M \
  --var-mods 1 \
  --out-lib "/data/${HUMAN_ECOLI_LIB}" \
  --threads "$THREADS"

echo ""
echo "======================================================"
echo " Spectral library generation finished"
echo "======================================================"
echo ""
echo "Generated files:"
ls -lh "$OUT_DIR"
echo ""
echo "Use this library for pooled tear-fluid DIA files:"
echo "  $HUMAN_LIB"
echo ""
echo "Use this library for dilution / E. coli spike-in files:"
echo "  $HUMAN_ECOLI_LIB"
echo ""
EOF
```

Make the script executable:

```bash
chmod +x generate_diann_libraries.sh
```

Run the script:

```bash
./generate_diann_libraries.sh
```

Check the generated libraries:

```bash
ls -lh results/diann/libraries
```

Expected output:

```text
human_swissprot.predicted.speclib
human_ecoli_swissprot.predicted.speclib
```
